    "message": "Classify all actual Wang tiles and prove positive horizontal complements\n\nProve exact membership in the ten printed families in both directions; bind target membership to the literal decimal actions, retaining halting target 215 and initializer head color 4. Prove target-restricted rail injectivity, disjoint directional ranges and every horizontal color below 250. Include the explicit off-target collision showing unrestricted rail injectivity is false.\n\nRecord root full-source review and fresh module/check replay with twelve standard-only axiom reports, the precise missing machine-language and cofinal-converse endpoints, and the independent isolated WholeField composition review. Preserve the actual maintained decimal equation and distinguish finite language classification from machine semantics.",
